{"reviewId": "27866253_87FPfWeP1", "review": {"abstract": "从图1-7中我们可以看出，美国全要素生产率的增长在2003年达到高点，而2002年之后，正是本轮大宗商品牛市的启动点。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "也就是说全要素生产率登顶之后，效率下降，资本想获得同样的产出就得加大投入，而加大投入就会导致大宗商品因为供求不平衡而涨价，继而迎来大宗商品牛市。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "9735-9794", "createTime": 1773747915, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "27866253_87FPfWeP1", "userVid": 27866253, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 27866253, "name": "Rainbow Sun", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/cNbGKuibzuTRgByYSetwWGxc1MBlH1IsOe1WolHribTrrwZdtF68unZFda4V8XyU3EDUh0LoOsbQ9y1ichmgtbMbm8DfjbVicw1oyGXFsKJvJT0/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 4, "likes": [{"userVid": 280516120, "name": "南山脚下一棵草🍵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELcYHnFX4VXqGOaCeibDpVyIGbZheCNYiaOr0rvnAkWqJUI7JhDAR0MvwW0yyV3rUuxp06w2xaEib0szg3rn5LVDkw7nIlTk0QayGC0TzSE8UFjQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-500", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数